#: ../../source/config_parts.rst:118
msgid ""
"``multiConnect`` says whether one instance of an interface may take more "
"than one object. It is ``false`` by default, because most joints are made "
"once: a stud takes one brick, a bolt hole takes one bolt, and two objects "
"connected to the same instance is a mistake ``pc test`` reports. Set it on "
"the joints that are not made once - a shaft carrying several parts along its"
" length, a rail, a bus bar:"
msgstr ""
"``multiConnect`` 说明一个接口实例是否可以接受多个对象。它默认为 ``false`` "
"，因为大多数连接只做一次：一个凸起容纳一块积木，一个螺栓孔容纳一颗螺栓，两个对象连接到同一个实例是 ``pc test`` "
"会报告的错误。请在那些并非只做一次的连接上设置它——沿轴长承载多个零件的轴、导轨、汇流排："

#: ../../source/config_parts.rst:131
msgid ""
"The ``threadStep``, ``selfScrew`` and ``multiConnect`` fields of an "
"interface are inherited by the interfaces that inherit it, and by the "
"connections made through it. Two interfaces that are connected have to agree"
" on their thread unless one of them cuts its own. See :doc:`/assy`."
msgstr ""
"接口的 ``threadStep`` 、 ``selfScrew`` 和 ``multiConnect`` "
"字段会被继承它的接口以及通过它建立的连接所继承。两个相互连接的接口必须在螺纹上保持一致，除非其中一个自攻出螺纹。参见 :doc:`/assy` 。"

#: ../../source/config_parts.rst:136
msgid ""
"The fields of the ``connect`` section are the defaults for the ``holdWith*``"
" and ``holdTo*`` fields of the ``how`` section of an Assembly YAML "
"``connect``/``connectPorts`` node. See :doc:`/assy`."
msgstr ""
"``connect`` 小节中的字段，是 Assembly YAML 中 ``connect``/``connectPorts`` 节点的 "
"``how`` 小节里 ``holdWith*`` 和 ``holdTo*`` 字段的默认值。参见 :doc:`/assy` 。"

#: ../../source/config_parts.rst:140
msgid ""
"``images`` names the pictures a part was modeled from -- a technical "
"drawing, a photograph, a sketch -- as paths relative to the package. They "
"are what ``pc render -t readme`` puts beside the part, next to its own "
"rendered image, so that a reader of the README sees what the model was made "
"to match. Assemblies, sketches and interfaces take the same field, and it "
"says nothing about how the object is built: nothing reads these images but "
"the README."
msgstr ""
"``images`` 以相对于包的路径列出建模该零件时所依据的图片——工程图、照片或草图。 ``pc render -t readme`` "
"会把它们放在零件旁边、紧挨着零件自身的渲染图像，这样 README "
"的读者就能看到模型当初是照着什么做出来的。装配体、草图和接口也接受同一个字段，而它完全不说明对象是如何构建的：除了 README "
"之外，没有任何东西会读取这些图片。"

#: ../../source/config_parts.rst:147
msgid ""
"The ``properties`` section says what the shape this part produces is, as "
"opposed to ``parameters``, which say what is asked of the type that produces"
" it. See :ref:`properties` below."
msgstr ""
"``properties`` 小节说明这个零件产出的形状是什么；与之相对， ``parameters`` "
"说明的是对产出它的类型提出了什么要求。请参见下面的 :ref:`properties` 。"

#: ../../source/config_parts.rst:151
msgid "See :ref:`location` for more information on the OCCT Location object."
msgstr "有关 OCCT Location 对象的更多信息，请参见 :ref:`location` 。"

